{"4020150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Labyrinth Trailblazer", "steam_appid": 4020150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Dungeon Crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a randomly generated labyrinth and encounter a variety of enemies and events. Build your party with different skills and equipments to defeat strong enemies and to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth Trailblazer takes traditional Dungeon Crawler and streamlines it for a more roguelike approach making it easier to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person dungeon crawler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based party combat: Characters and enemies will take one turn each before they can act again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shows the outcome of your actions in complex scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prediction system that displays enemy intents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn or upgrade skills after every fight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eafbbdb14ba20f82.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eafbbdb14ba20f82.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eafbbdb14ba20f82.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit new party members and heal your party at campfire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/30a374168ad158a92f03c6caf763c881.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add markers for points of interest on your map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/ec94271b70c62213c91f2946ed72b32d.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You grow strong very quickly but if you are defeated, you will need to restart from the beginning. It is quick to start another run and try again with a new strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ animated monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 areas with different themes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty modifier to change the way the game is played</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated dungeon</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Dungeon Crawler Rogue-like with strategic combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a randomly generated labyrinth and encounter a variety of enemies and events. Build your party with different skills and equipments to defeat strong enemies and to conquer the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Labyrinth Trailblazer takes traditional Dungeon Crawler and streamlines it for a more roguelike approach making it easier to pick up and play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person dungeon crawler</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/b9a0f35ea4a1623006d416d07bbc78cf.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn based party combat: Characters and enemies will take one turn each before they can act again.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shows the outcome of your actions in complex scenarios.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/7f13b916d33297f0a8a06b8b7650528d.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prediction system that displays enemy intents</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.poster.avif?t=1782786167\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.webm?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/8fc974c4f02fa79ebf94fbfeff0a8fff.mp4?t=1782786167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn or upgrade skills after every fight</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020150/extras/c4d05bf664f1b0c3eaf